# ghostty-mirror.nvim writes auto-generated tmux theme caches into this dir.
# Those are disposable (regenerated on demand), so ignore every .conf by default
# and track only hand-made overrides.
#
# When you author a NEW hand-made theme, add a line for it below:
#   !my-colorscheme.conf
*.conf
!scintilla-amethyst.conf
!scintilla-sapphire.conf
